{"id":"greve","lemma":"greve","pos":"noun","rank":2930,"glosses":["strike (work stoppage)"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɾɛ.vi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7f/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-greve.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-greve.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"greves"},"examples":[{"text":"A greve parou a cidade.","en":"The strike brought the city to a halt.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to stop","l":"parar"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"city, town"}]},{"text":"Temos o direito de greve.","en":"We have the right to strike.","words":[{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"right (toward the right…"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Não se trata exatamente de uma greve.","en":"It's not exactly a strike.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to treat","l":"tratar"},{"g":"exactly"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"A greve durou três dias.","en":"The strike lasted three days.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to last, endure","l":"durar"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"period between sunrise…","l":"dia"}]},{"text":"Quem porá fim a essa greve?","en":"Who is going to put and end to this strike?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to put","l":"pôr"},{"g":"end"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"that, that one","l":"esse"},null]}]}